    <briefdescription>
<para>Thread-safe cache wrapper using a std::unordered_map + mutex. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Provides a simple concurrent cache implementation when TBB containers are unavailable in the build environment.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="templateparam"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>Key</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Key type used for map lookup. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>Value</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Value type stored in the cache. </para>
</parameterdescription>
